OL,3,AJudge orders Trump administration to
OL,4,Astop threatening US election officials
OL,5,
OL,6,FA federal judge has ordered the federal
OL,7,Fgovernment to stop threatening local
OL,8,Fand state election officials with
OL,9,Fcriminal charges over their role in
OL,10,Fprocessing election ballots.
OL,12,FThe California judge ruled that the
OL,13,FDepartment of Justice (DoJ) must stop
OL,14,Fdemanding that local and state election
OL,15,Fofficials set aside or not process
OL,16,Fcertain ballots that the Trump
OL,17,Fadministration alleges may come from
OL,18,Fnon-citizens.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
