OL,3,AJudge orders Trump administration to
OL,4,Astop threatening US election officials
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ruling comes days before the
OL,7,Fmidterm elections, which will determine
OL,8,Fwhich political party controls the US
OL,9,FCongress for the last two years of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency.
OL,12,FTrump criticised the ruling on
OL,13,FSaturday, writing,"Why would they
OL,14,Freject fixing Election Fraud?"
